# Direct dependencies of the code generators. Human-edited.
#
# `requirements.txt` next to this file is the machine-generated lock with every
# transitive dependency pinned and hashed; regenerate it with:
#
#     uv pip compile tools/codegen/requirements.in --generate-hashes \
#       --python-version 3.12 -o tools/codegen/requirements.txt
#
# (`pip-compile` from pip-tools produces the same format if uv is unavailable.)
#
# The google-genai pin must match PINNED_VERSION in upstream.py: the generators
# stamp that version into every generated header, and assert_supported_version()
# refuses to run if the installed package disagrees.
